Zoë Park: quick QA note — the toolbar primary (Create) looks narrower than the same primary inside the modal; on small widths the toast animates in and nudges the toolbar left for a moment. anyone else seeing layout shift?

Arjun Sinha: yes, noticed during mobile pass. toolbar uses compact horizontal padding and a stronger shadow; modal primary is wider and softer. toast animation is translate+opacity and causes reflow for sticky elements. :grimacing: 

Lena Morales: token drift again. toolbar uses `--rwd-space-2` for button-inline while modal uses `--rwd-space-3`. also toast container is `position: fixed` but our sticky toolbar lives inside a wrapper that responds to bottom changes.

Zoë Park: repro: Console > Backups > toolbar Create vs open Backup > Edit modal > Save. On 375px trigger a toast; watch toolbar shift ~80-120ms.

Arjun Sinha: snippet from storybook showing suspects:
```css
.toolbar .btn.primary { padding: var(--rwd-space-2) var(--rwd-space-3); box-shadow: var(--rwd-elev-3); }
.modal .footer .btn.primary { padding: var(--rwd-space-3) var(--rwd-space-4); box-shadow: var(--rwd-elev-2); }
.toast-container { bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 16px); left: 16px; transition: transform 240ms ease, opacity 240ms ease; }
.table-wrapper.sticky-bottom { padding-bottom: 0; }
```

Lena Morales: proposal: 1) add explicit tokens `--rwd-action-toolbar-pad` and `--rwd-action-modal-pad` mapped from canonical `--rwd-button-inline` so changes are intentional. 2) change toast entrance to opacity + translateY but use will-change and prefer-reduced-motion friendly variant. 3) when `.toast-container` has children, add `padding-bottom: var(--rwd-toast-bottom-safe)` to sticky wrappers instead of relying on z-index.

Zoë Park: +1. small copy nit: toolbar CTA reads "Create Backup" while modal primary is "Create"; prefer short in toolbar, full in modal. add guidance to Buttons docs: "Inline: concise, Modal: descriptive".

Arjun Sinha: accessibility checklist: ensure hit target >= 44x44 after padding changes, focus ring color `--rwd-focus-strong` at 3px offset, and run Axe on reduced-motion. Also add a screenshot test for toolbar+modal+toast at narrow widths.

DesignBot: Preview build queued for branch `ui/toolbar-toast-tokens` (PR #5012). Running visual-regression and a11y-lint.

Lena Morales: implementation note — avoid changing toast z-index; reserving safe space via token is less brittle with overlays like dialogs and menus. sample css suggestion added to PR: ```css
:root { --rwd-toast-bottom-safe: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + var(--rwd-space-3)); }
.toast { transform: translateY(12px); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .toast { transform: none; transition: opacity 120ms linear; } }
.table-wrapper.sticky-bottom.toast-visible { padding-bottom: var(--rwd-toast-bottom-safe); }
```

Arjun Sinha: good. also standardize toast entrance to 200ms to match other overlays and press animations to 180ms for button ripples. reduces perceived jank.

Zoë Park: can we add a combined story in storybook showing toolbar+modal+toast+reduced-motion so visual-regression captures both interaction and accessibility config?

QA-Bot: Visual snapshot job created for branch `ui/toolbar-toast-tokens` (stories: buttons/toolbar-vs-modal, toast/safe-area, accessibility/reduced-motion).

Lena Morales: added migration note in tokens.md and replaced hard-coded px in toolbar styles. pushing a PR with stories attached. assigning @Arjun for a11y checklist and @Zoë for copy updates.

DesignBot: PR #5012 preview ready: https://deploy.preview/r/5012 — checks: visual-regression OK for desktop, a11y-lint flagged 1 advisory (reduced-motion behavior) assigned to Arjun.

Arjun Sinha: small follow-up — reduced-motion advisory is about the translate being present for a11y fallback in one theme. I'll patch to ensure `transform: none` is forced under prefers-reduced-motion and update the story to simulate it.

Zoë Park: thanks — once reduced-motion is green, please merge. Also updated Buttons docs with the inline vs modal copy guidance.

DesignBot: PR #5012 merged to staging. Changed stories: buttons/toolbar-vs-modal, toast/safe-area, accessibility/reduced-motion. CI: visual-regression passed, a11y advisory cleared after patch.
